{"id":"36af0421393081fa4c79650c294cef02650fc710","axis":"silent","repo":"TYPO3/typo3","sha":"36af0421393081fa4c79650c294cef02650fc710","parsed":{"files":[{"path":"typo3/sysext/core/Documentation/Changelog/15.0/Deprecation-111134-TransientForSkippingValidation.rst","lines":["@@ -0,0 +1,85 @@","+..  include:: /Includes.rst.txt","+","+..  _deprecation-111134-1792300002:","+","+===========================================================","+Deprecation: #111134 - #[Transient] for skipping validation","+===========================================================","+","+See :issue:`111134`","+","+Description","+===========","+","+Since :issue:`91727`, the Extbase attribute","+:php:`\\TYPO3\\CMS\\Extbase\\Attribute\\ORM\\Transient` also skips the validator that","+Extbase generates automatically for properties typed as another model or as a","+collection. This coupled validation to a persistence attribute.","+","+Relying on :php:`#[Transient]` to skip validation of such a property has been","+marked as deprecated and will be removed in TYPO3 v16.0. The new attribute","+:php:`\\TYPO3\\CMS\\Extbase\\Attribute\\IgnoreValidation` can be used on properties","+instead, see :ref:`feature-111134-1792300001`.","+","+Impact","+======","+","+Extbase triggers a PHP deprecation warning when it builds the validators of a","+model that has a property with :php:`#[Transient]` and no","+:php:`#[IgnoreValidation]`, and Extbase would otherwise generate a validator","+for that property. This applies to properties typed as another model and to","+typed collections such as :php:`ObjectStorage<Category>`. The validator is","+still skipped until TYPO3 v16.0. Starting with TYPO3 v16.0, :php:`#[Transient]`","+does not influence validation anymore and the automatically generated validator","+is applied.","+","+Properties for which Extbase never generates a validator, for example","+properties of simple types or of singleton classes, are not affected and","+trigger no deprecation.","+","+Properties typed as other classes, for example :php:`\\DateTimeImmutable`,","+trigger the deprecation as well, although the validator generated for them is","+empty. Adding :php:`#[IgnoreValidation]` to such a property silences the","+deprecation and changes nothing else.","+","+Affected installations","+======================","+","+TYPO3 installations with extensions that have domain model properties with","+:php:`#[Transient]` that are typed as another model or as a typed collection,","+for example :php:`ObjectStorage<Category>`, are affected. The extension scanner","+cannot detect this, since the deprecated behavior is the side effect of an","+attribute.","+","+Migration","+=========","+","+Replace :php:`#[Transient]` with :php:`#[IgnoreValidation]` on every property","+that should not be validated. :php:`#[Transient]` is not needed to keep a","+property out of persistence: Extbase only maps properties that have a matching","+column in the TCA. This can be automated with a Rector rule that replaces","+:php:`#[Transient]` with :php:`#[IgnoreValidation]` on every property with a","+non-simple type.","+","+..  code-block:: php","+    :caption: Before (deprecated)","+","+    use TYPO3\\CMS\\Extbase\\Attribute\\ORM\\Transient;","+","+    #[Transient]","+    protected ?Category $category = null;","+","+..  code-block:: php","+    :caption: After","+","+    use TYPO3\\CMS\\Extbase\\Attribute\\IgnoreValidation;","+","+    #[IgnoreValidation]","+    protected ?Category $category = null;","+","+Extensions that also support TYPO3 v13.4 or v14 keep :php:`#[Transient]` next","+to :php:`#[IgnoreValidation]` until they drop support for these versions.","+Extbase in TYPO3 v13.4 and v14 does not evaluate unknown property attributes,","+so the same code works in TYPO3 v13.4, v14 and v15.","+","+..  index:: PHP-API, NotScanned, ext:extbase"],"additions":85,"deletions":0,"truncated":false},{"path":"typo3/sysext/core/Documentation/Changelog/15.0/Feature-111134-AllowIgnoreValidationOnProperties.rst","lines":["@@ -0,0 +1,53 @@","+..  include:: /Includes.rst.txt","+","+..  _feature-111134-1792300001:","+","+==================================================================","+Feature: #111134 - Allow #[IgnoreValidation] on Extbase properties","+==================================================================","+","+See :issue:`111134`","+","+Description","+===========","+","+The PHP attribute :php:`\\TYPO3\\CMS\\Extbase\\Attribute\\IgnoreValidation` can now","+be applied to properties of Extbase domain models, in addition to action","+parameters of controller methods.","+","+A property marked with :php:`#[IgnoreValidation]` is excluded from the","+validation of its model completely: Extbase neither creates the validators it","+would generate automatically for properties typed as another model or as a","+collection, nor does it apply validators declared with :php:`#[Validate]` or","+with Symfony constraint attributes on that property. This is the same meaning","+:php:`#[IgnoreValidation]` has on action parameters.","+","+..  code-block:: php","+    :caption: EXT:my_extension/Classes/Domain/Model/Product.php","+","+    use TYPO3\\CMS\\Extbase\\Attribute\\IgnoreValidation;","+","+    class Product extends AbstractEntity","+    {","+        #[IgnoreValidation]","+        protected ?Category $category = null;","+    }","+","+Excluding a property from validation is independent of its persistence.","+Whether a property is persisted is decided by the TCA: Extbase only maps","+properties that have a matching column. :php:`#[Transient]` is not needed for","+either purpose.","+","+Impact","+======","+","+Extension authors can exclude single model properties from validation, for","+example model-typed properties without accessor methods, without having to mark","+them as transient.","+","+Extensions that support TYPO3 v13.4, v14 and v15 can carry both attributes on","+a property. Extbase in TYPO3 v13.4 and v14 does not evaluate unknown property","+attributes, so :php:`#[IgnoreValidation]` is simply ignored there, while","+:php:`#[Transient]` keeps skipping the validator.","+","+..  index:: PHP-API, NotScanned, ext:extbase"],"additions":53,"deletions":0,"truncated":false},{"path":"typo3/sysext/extbase/Classes/Attribute/IgnoreValidation.php","lines":["@@ -17,5 +17,5 @@"," "," namespace TYPO3\\CMS\\Extbase\\Attribute;"," ","-#[\\Attribute(\\Attribute::TARGET_PARAMETER)]","+#[\\Attribute(\\Attribute::TARGET_PARAMETER | \\Attribute::TARGET_PROPERTY)]"," class IgnoreValidation {}"],"additions":1,"deletions":1,"truncated":false},{"path":"typo3/sysext/extbase/Classes/Reflection/ClassSchema.php","lines":["@@ -119,6 +119,7 @@ protected function reflectProperties(\\ReflectionClass $reflectionClass): void","                     Attribute\\FileUpload::class => $fileUploadAttributes[] = $attribute,","                     Attribute\\ORM\\Lazy::class => $propertyCharacteristicsBit += PropertyCharacteristics::ANNOTATED_LAZY,","                     Attribute\\ORM\\Transient::class => $propertyCharacteristicsBit += PropertyCharacteristics::ANNOTATED_TRANSIENT,","+                    Attribute\\IgnoreValidation::class => $propertyCharacteristicsBit += PropertyCharacteristics::ANNOTATED_IGNORE_VALIDATION,","                     Attribute\\ORM\\Cascade::class => $this->properties[$propertyName]['c'] = $attribute->newInstance()->value,","                     default => '' // non-extbase attributes","                 };"],"additions":1,"deletions":0,"truncated":false},{"path":"typo3/sysext/extbase/Classes/Reflection/ClassSchema/Property.php","lines":["@@ -205,6 +205,11 @@ public function isTransient(): bool","         return $this->characteristics->get(PropertyCharacteristics::ANNOTATED_TRANSIENT);","     }"," ","+    public function ignoreValidation(): bool","+    {","+        return $this->characteristics->get(PropertyCharacteristics::ANNOTATED_IGNORE_VALIDATION);","+    }","+","     public function isNullable(): bool","     {","         $primaryType = $this->getPrimaryType();"],"additions":5,"deletions":0,"truncated":false},{"path":"typo3/sysext/extbase/Classes/Reflection/ClassSchema/PropertyCharacteristics.php","lines":["@@ -29,4 +29,5 @@ final class PropertyCharacteristics extends BitSet","     public const int VISIBILITY_PUBLIC = 1 << 2;","     public const int ANNOTATED_LAZY = 1 << 4;","     public const int ANNOTATED_TRANSIENT = 1 << 5;","+    public const int ANNOTATED_IGNORE_VALIDATION = 1 << 6;"," }"],"additions":1,"deletions":0,"truncated":false},{"path":"typo3/sysext/extbase/Classes/Validation/ValidatorResolver.php","lines":["@@ -124,6 +124,10 @@ protected function buildBaseValidatorConjunction(","         /** @var GenericObjectValidator $objectValidator */","         $objectValidator = $this->createValidator(GenericObjectValidator::class);","         foreach ($classSchema->getProperties() as $property) {","+            if ($property->ignoreValidation()) {","+                continue;","+            }","+","             $primaryType = $property->getPrimaryType();","             if (!$primaryType instanceof TypeAdapter) {","                 // @todo: The type is only necessary here for further analyzing whether it's a simple type or","@@ -137,23 +141,25 @@ protected function buildBaseValidatorConjunction("," ","             $propertyTargetClassName = $primaryType->getClassName() ?? $primaryType->getBuiltinType();"," ","-            // Skip transient properties for auto-generated validators (model-typed properties).","-            // Transient properties are not persisted and may not have public accessors.","-            if (!TypeHandlingUtility::isSimpleType($propertyTargetClassName) && !$property->isTransient()) {","+            if (!TypeHandlingUtility::isSimpleType($propertyTargetClassName)) {","                 // The outer simpleType check reduces lookups to the class loader","                 // @todo: Whether the property holds a simple type or not and whether it holds a collection is known in","                 //        in the ClassSchema. The information could be made available and not evaluated here again.","                 $primaryCollectionValueType = $property->getPrimaryCollectionValueType();","                 if ($primaryType->isCollection() && $primaryCollectionValueType instanceof TypeAdapter) {","-                    /** @var CollectionValidator $collectionValidator */","-                    $collectionValidator = $this->createValidator(","-                        CollectionValidator::class,","-                        [","-                            'elementType' => $primaryCollectionValueType->getClassName() ?? $primaryCollectionValueType->getBuiltinType(),","-                        ],","-                        $request","-                    );","-                    $objectValidator->addPropertyValidator($property->getName(), $collectionValidator);","+                    if ($property->isTransient()) {","+                        $this->triggerTransientValidationDeprecation($targetClassName, $property->getName());","+                    } else {","+                        /** @var CollectionValidator $collectionValidator */","+                        $collectionValidator = $this->createValidator(","+                            CollectionValidator::class,","+                            [","+                                'elementType' => $primaryCollectionValueType->getClassName() ?? $primaryCollectionValueType->getBuiltinType(),","+                            ],","+                            $request","+                        );","+                        $objectValidator->addPropertyValidator($property->getName(), $collectionValidator);","+                    }","                 } elseif (class_exists($propertyTargetClassName)","                     && !TypeHandlingUtility::isCoreType($propertyTargetClassName)","                     && !in_array(SingletonInterface::class, class_implements($propertyTargetClassName) ?: [], true)","@@ -173,9 +179,13 @@ protected function buildBaseValidatorConjunction(","                     // relations in models. Still, the question remains why it excludes core types and singletons.","                     // It makes sense on a theoretical level, but I don't see a technical issue allowing these as","                     // well.","-                    $validatorForProperty = $this->getBaseValidatorConjunction($propertyTargetClassName, $request);","-                    if ($validatorForProperty->count() > 0) {","-                        $objectValidator->addPropertyValidator($property->getName(), $validatorForProperty);","+                    if ($property->isTransient()) {","+                        $this->triggerTransientValidationDeprecation($targetClassName, $property->getName());","+                    } else {","+                        $validatorForProperty = $this->getBaseValidatorConjunction($propertyTargetClassName, $request);","+                        if ($validatorForProperty->count() > 0) {","+                            $objectValidator->addPropertyValidator($property->getName(), $validatorForProperty);","+                        }","                     }","                 }","             }","@@ -210,4 +220,18 @@ protected function buildBaseValidatorConjunction(","             $conjunctionValidator->addValidator($objectValidator);","         }","     }","+","+    /**","+     * @deprecated since v15, will be removed in v16: skipping validation via #[Transient].","+     *             Properties with #[IgnoreValidation] never reach this method.","+     */","+    private function triggerTransientValidationDeprecation(string $className, string $propertyName): void","+    {","+        trigger_error(","+            'Property ' . $className . '::$' . $propertyName . ' uses #[Transient] to skip validation.'","+            . ' This is deprecated since TYPO3 v15.0 and will be removed in TYPO3 v16.0.'","+            . ' Add #[IgnoreValidation] to the property instead.',","+            E_USER_DEPRECATED","+        );","+    }"," }"],"additions":39,"deletions":15,"truncated":false},{"path":"typo3/sysext/extbase/Tests/Functional/Fixtures/Extensions/test_validators/Classes/Domain/Model/ModelWithIgnoredValidationAndValidateProperty.php","lines":["@@ -0,0 +1,34 @@","+<?php","+","+declare(strict_types=1);","+","+/*","+ * This file is part of the TYPO3 CMS project.","+ *","+ * It is free software; you can redistribute it and/or modify it under","+ * the terms of the GNU General Public License, either version 2","+ * of the License, or any later version.","+ *","+ * For the full copyright and license information, please read the","+ * LICENSE.txt file that was distributed with this source code.","+ *","+ * The TYPO3 project - inspiring people to share!","+ */","+","+namespace TYPO3Tests\\TestValidators\\Domain\\Model;","+","+use TYPO3\\CMS\\Extbase\\Attribute as Extbase;","+use TYPO3\\CMS\\Extbase\\DomainObject\\AbstractEntity;","+","+/**","+ * Fixture model with a property that carries an explicit validator and is excluded from validation.","+ */","+class ModelWithIgnoredValidationAndValidateProperty extends AbstractEntity","+{","+    #[Extbase\\Validate(validator: 'NotEmpty')]","+    protected string $title = '';","+","+    #[Extbase\\IgnoreValidation]","+    #[Extbase\\Validate(validator: 'NotEmpty')]","+    protected string $ignored = '';","+}"],"additions":34,"deletions":0,"truncated":false},{"path":"typo3/sysext/extbase/Tests/Functional/Fixtures/Extensions/test_validators/Classes/Domain/Model/ModelWithIgnoredValidationProperty.php","lines":["@@ -0,0 +1,33 @@","+<?php","+","+declare(strict_types=1);","+","+/*","+ * This file is part of the TYPO3 CMS project.","+ *","+ * It is free software; you can redistribute it and/or modify it under","+ * the terms of the GNU General Public License, either version 2","+ * of the License, or any later version.","+ *","+ * For the full copyright and license information, please read the","+ * LICENSE.txt file that was distributed with this source code.","+ *","+ * The TYPO3 project - inspiring people to share!","+ */","+","+namespace TYPO3Tests\\TestValidators\\Domain\\Model;","+","+use TYPO3\\CMS\\Extbase\\Attribute as Extbase;","+use TYPO3\\CMS\\Extbase\\DomainObject\\AbstractEntity;","+","+/**","+ * Fixture model with a model-typed property without accessors that is excluded from validation.","+ */","+class ModelWithIgnoredValidationProperty extends AbstractEntity","+{","+    #[Extbase\\Validate(validator: 'NotEmpty')]","+    protected string $title = '';","+","+    #[Extbase\\IgnoreValidation]","+    protected ?AnotherModel $ignoredRelation = null;","+}"],"additions":33,"deletions":0,"truncated":false},{"path":"typo3/sysext/extbase/Tests/Functional/Fixtures/Extensions/test_validators/Classes/Domain/Model/ModelWithTransientAndIgnoredValidationProperty.php","lines":["@@ -0,0 +1,34 @@","+<?php","+","+declare(strict_types=1);","+","+/*","+ * This file is part of the TYPO3 CMS project.","+ *","+ * It is free software; you can redistribute it and/or modify it under","+ * the terms of the GNU General Public License, either version 2","+ * of the License, or any later version.","+ *","+ * For the full copyright and license information, please read the","+ * LICENSE.txt file that was distributed with this source code.","+ *","+ * The TYPO3 project - inspiring people to share!","+ */","+","+namespace TYPO3Tests\\TestValidators\\Domain\\Model;","+","+use TYPO3\\CMS\\Extbase\\Attribute as Extbase;","+use TYPO3\\CMS\\Extbase\\DomainObject\\AbstractEntity;","+","+/**","+ * Fixture model with a model-typed property without accessors that is transient and excluded from validation.","+ */","+class ModelWithTransientAndIgnoredValidationProperty extends AbstractEntity","+{","+    #[Extbase\\Validate(validator: 'NotEmpty')]","+    protected string $title = '';","+","+    #[Extbase\\ORM\\Transient]","+    #[Extbase\\IgnoreValidation]","+    protected ?AnotherModel $transientRelation = null;","+}"],"additions":34,"deletions":0,"truncated":false},{"path":"typo3/sysext/extbase/Tests/Functional/Fixtures/Extensions/test_validators/Classes/Domain/Model/ModelWithTransientCollectionProperty.php","lines":["@@ -0,0 +1,37 @@","+<?php","+","+declare(strict_types=1);","+","+/*","+ * This file is part of the TYPO3 CMS project.","+ *","+ * It is free software; you can redistribute it and/or modify it under","+ * the terms of the GNU General Public License, either version 2","+ * of the License, or any later version.","+ *","+ * For the full copyright and license information, please read the","+ * LICENSE.txt file that was distributed with this source code.","+ *","+ * The TYPO3 project - inspiring people to share!","+ */","+","+namespace TYPO3Tests\\TestValidators\\Domain\\Model;","+","+use TYPO3\\CMS\\Extbase\\Attribute as Extbase;","+use TYPO3\\CMS\\Extbase\\DomainObject\\AbstractEntity;","+use TYPO3\\CMS\\Extbase\\Persistence\\ObjectStorage;","+","+/**","+ * Fixture model with a transient collection property, which gets an auto-generated validator without the attribute.","+ */","+class ModelWithTransientCollectionProperty extends AbstractEntity","+{","+    #[Extbase\\Validate(validator: 'NotEmpty')]","+    protected string $title = '';","+","+    /**","+     * @var ObjectStorage<AnotherModel>","+     */","+    #[Extbase\\ORM\\Transient]","+    protected ObjectStorage $transientCollection;","+}"],"additions":37,"deletions":0,"truncated":false},{"path":"typo3/sysext/extbase/Tests/Functional/Fixtures/Extensions/test_validators/Classes/Domain/Model/ModelWithTransientSingletonProperty.php","lines":["@@ -0,0 +1,34 @@","+<?php","+","+declare(strict_types=1);","+","+/*","+ * This file is part of the TYPO3 CMS project.","+ *","+ * It is free software; you can redistribute it and/or modify it under","+ * the terms of the GNU General Public License, either version 2","+ * of the License, or any later version.","+ *","+ * For the full copyright and license information, please read the","+ * LICENSE.txt file that was distributed with this source code.","+ *","+ * The TYPO3 project - inspiring people to share!","+ */","+","+namespace TYPO3Tests\\TestValidators\\Domain\\Model;","+","+use TYPO3\\CMS\\Core\\Context\\Context;","+use TYPO3\\CMS\\Extbase\\Attribute as Extbase;","+use TYPO3\\CMS\\Extbase\\DomainObject\\AbstractEntity;","+","+/**","+ * Fixture model with a transient property typed as a singleton class, which never gets an auto-generated validator.","+ */","+class ModelWithTransientSingletonProperty extends AbstractEntity","+{","+    #[Extbase\\Validate(validator: 'NotEmpty')]","+    protected string $title = '';","+","+    #[Extbase\\ORM\\Transient]","+    protected ?Context $transientContext = null;","+}"],"additions":34,"deletions":0,"truncated":false},{"path":"typo3/sysext/extbase/Tests/Functional/Validation/ValidatorResolverTest.php","lines":["@@ -19,6 +19,7 @@"," "," use PHPUnit\\Framework\\Attributes\\AllowMockObjectsWithoutExpectations;"," use PHPUnit\\Framework\\Attributes\\DataProvider;","+use PHPUnit\\Framework\\Attributes\\IgnoreDeprecations;"," use PHPUnit\\Framework\\Attributes\\Test;"," use TYPO3\\CMS\\Extbase\\Error\\Error;"," use TYPO3\\CMS\\Extbase\\Error\\Result;","@@ -34,7 +35,12 @@"," use TYPO3Tests\\TestValidators\\Domain\\Model\\AnotherModel;"," use TYPO3Tests\\TestValidators\\Domain\\Model\\MixedSymfonyModel;"," use TYPO3Tests\\TestValidators\\Domain\\Model\\Model;","+use TYPO3Tests\\TestValidators\\Domain\\Model\\ModelWithIgnoredValidationAndValidateProperty;","+use TYPO3Tests\\TestValidators\\Domain\\Model\\ModelWithIgnoredValidationProperty;","+use TYPO3Tests\\TestValidators\\Domain\\Model\\ModelWithTransientAndIgnoredValidationProperty;","+use TYPO3Tests\\TestValidators\\Domain\\Model\\ModelWithTransientCollectionProperty;"," use TYPO3Tests\\TestValidators\\Domain\\Model\\ModelWithTransientProperty;","+use TYPO3Tests\\TestValidators\\Domain\\Model\\ModelWithTransientSingletonProperty;"," use TYPO3Tests\\TestValidators\\Domain\\Model\\SymfonyModel;"," use TYPO3Tests\\TestValidators\\Validation\\Validator\\CustomValidator;"," ","@@ -289,9 +295,16 @@ public function SymfonyValidatorsCanBeMixedWithExtbaseValidators(string $input,","         $this->assertErrorObjectsAreSame($expectedErrorResults, $results);","     }"," ","+    /**","+     * A model-typed #[Transient] property without accessors is still skipped, but the","+     * missing #[IgnoreValidation] is reported as deprecated.","+     */","     #[Test]","+    #[IgnoreDeprecations]","     public function transientPropertiesWithoutGetterAreSkippedDuringValidation(): void","     {","+        $this->expectUserDeprecationMessageMatches('/ModelWithTransientProperty::\\$transientRelation.*#\\[IgnoreValidation\\]/');","+","         $subject = $this->getAccessibleMock(","             ValidatorResolver::class,","             null,","@@ -320,6 +333,137 @@ public function transientPropertiesWithoutGetterAreSkippedDuringValidation(): vo","         self::assertFalse($result->hasErrors());","     }"," ","+    /**","+     * A model-typed property without accessors that is marked with #[IgnoreValidation] gets","+     * no validator and does not make the resolver throw.","+     */","+    #[Test]","+    public function propertyWithIgnoreValidationGetsNoAutoGeneratedValidator(): void","+    {","+        // Given: a model with a validated string property and an ignored model-typed property without accessors","+        $subject = $this->get(ValidatorResolver::class);","+","+        // When: the base validator conjunction of the model is built","+        $conjunction = $subject->getBaseValidatorConjunction(ModelWithIgnoredValidationProperty::class);","+","+        // Then: only the validated string property has a validator","+        $validatorClassNamesByProperty = [];","+        foreach ($conjunction->getValidators() as $objectValidator) {","+            self::assertInstanceOf(GenericObjectValidator::class, $objectValidator);","+            foreach ($objectValidator->getPropertyValidators() as $propertyName => $propertyValidators) {","+                foreach ($propertyValidators as $propertyValidator) {","+                    $validatorClassNamesByProperty[$propertyName][] = $propertyValidator::class;","+                }","+            }","+        }","+        self::assertSame(['title' => [NotEmptyValidator::class]], $validatorClassNamesByProperty);","+    }","+","+    /**","+     * #[IgnoreValidation] on a property also suppresses validators declared via #[Validate].","+     */","+    #[Test]","+    public function propertyWithIgnoreValidationGetsNoExplicitValidator(): void","+    {","+        // Given: a model with two string properties, both with #[Validate], one also with #[IgnoreValidation]","+        $subject = $this->get(ValidatorResolver::class);","+","+        // When: the base validator conjunction of the model is built","+        $conjunction = $subject->getBaseValidatorConjunction(ModelWithIgnoredValidationAndValidateProperty::class);","+","+        // Then: only the property without #[IgnoreValidation] has a validator","+        $validatorClassNamesByProperty = [];","+        foreach ($conjunction->getValidators() as $objectValidator) {","+            self::assertInstanceOf(GenericObjectValidator::class, $objectValidator);","+            foreach ($objectValidator->getPropertyValidators() as $propertyName => $propertyValidators) {","+                foreach ($propertyValidators as $propertyValidator) {","+                    $validatorClassNamesByProperty[$propertyName][] = $propertyValidator::class;","+                }","+            }","+        }","+        self::assertSame(['title' => [NotEmptyValidator::class]], $validatorClassNamesByProperty);","+    }","+","+    /**","+     * A property with both #[Transient] and #[IgnoreValidation] is skipped without a deprecation.","+     */","+    #[Test]","+    public function transientPropertyWithIgnoreValidationIsSkippedWithoutDeprecation(): void","+    {","+        // Given: a model with a validated string property and a transient, ignored model-typed property without accessors","+        $subject = $this->get(ValidatorResolver::class);","+","+        // When: the base validator conjunction of the model is built","+        $conjunction = $subject->getBaseValidatorConjunction(ModelWithTransientAndIgnoredValidationProperty::class);","+","+        // Then: only the string property has a validator and no deprecation was triggered","+        $validatorClassNamesByProperty = [];","+        foreach ($conjunction->getValidators() as $objectValidator) {","+            self::assertInstanceOf(GenericObjectValidator::class, $objectValidator);","+            foreach ($objectValidator->getPropertyValidators() as $propertyName => $propertyValidators) {","+                foreach ($propertyValidators as $propertyValidator) {","+                    $validatorClassNamesByProperty[$propertyName][] = $propertyValidator::class;","+                }","+            }","+        }","+        self::assertSame(['title' => [NotEmptyValidator::class]], $validatorClassNamesByProperty);","+    }","+","+    /**","+     * A #[Transient] property typed as a singleton class never gets an auto-generated validator,","+     * so #[Transient] changes nothing and no deprecation is triggered.","+     */","+    #[Test]","+    public function transientSingletonPropertyTriggersNoDeprecation(): void","+    {","+        // Given: a model with a validated string property and a transient property typed as a singleton class","+        $subject = $this->get(ValidatorResolver::class);","+","+        // When: the base validator conjunction of the model is built","+        $conjunction = $subject->getBaseValidatorConjunction(ModelWithTransientSingletonProperty::class);","+","+        // Then: only the string property has a validator and no deprecation was triggered","+        $validatorClassNamesByProperty = [];","+        foreach ($conjunction->getValidators() as $objectValidator) {","+            self::assertInstanceOf(GenericObjectValidator::class, $objectValidator);","+            foreach ($objectValidator->getPropertyValidators() as $propertyName => $propertyValidators) {","+                foreach ($propertyValidators as $propertyValidator) {","+                    $validatorClassNamesByProperty[$propertyName][] = $propertyValidator::class;","+                }","+            }","+        }","+        self::assertSame(['title' => [NotEmptyValidator::class]], $validatorClassNamesByProperty);","+    }","+","+    /**","+     * A #[Transient] collection property would get a collection validator without the","+     * attribute, so the skip is reported as deprecated.","+     */","+    #[Test]","+    #[IgnoreDeprecations]","+    public function transientCollectionPropertyIsSkippedWithDeprecation(): void","+    {","+        $this->expectUserDeprecationMessageMatches('/ModelWithTransientCollectionProperty::\\$transientCollection.*#\\[IgnoreValidation\\]/');","+","+        // Given: a model with a validated string property and a transient collection property of models","+        $subject = $this->get(ValidatorResolver::class);","+","+        // When: the base validator conjunction of the model is built","+        $conjunction = $subject->getBaseValidatorConjunction(ModelWithTransientCollectionProperty::class);","+","+        // Then: only the string property has a validator and the deprecation was triggered","+        $validatorClassNamesByProperty = [];","+        foreach ($conjunction->getValidators() as $objectValidator) {","+            self::assertInstanceOf(GenericObjectValidator::class, $objectValidator);","+            foreach ($objectValidator->getPropertyValidators() as $propertyName => $propertyValidators) {","+                foreach ($propertyValidators as $propertyValidator) {","+                    $validatorClassNamesByProperty[$propertyName][] = $propertyValidator::class;","+                }","+            }","+        }","+        self::assertSame(['title' => [NotEmptyValidator::class]], $validatorClassNamesByProperty);","+    }","+","     private function assertErrorObjectsAreSame(array $expectedErrorResults, array $results): void","     {","         self::assertCount(count($expectedErrorResults), $results);"],"additions":144,"deletions":0,"truncated":false},{"path":"typo3/sysext/extbase/Tests/Unit/Reflection/ClassSchema/PropertyTest.php","lines":["@@ -22,6 +22,7 @@"," use TYPO3\\CMS\\Extbase\\Persistence\\ObjectStorage;"," use TYPO3\\CMS\\Extbase\\Reflection\\ClassSchema;"," use TYPO3\\CMS\\Extbase\\Tests\\Unit\\Reflection\\Fixture\\DummyClassWithAllTypesOfProperties;","+use TYPO3\\CMS\\Extbase\\Tests\\Unit\\Reflection\\Fixture\\DummyClassWithIgnoreValidationOnProperty;"," use TYPO3\\CMS\\Extbase\\Tests\\Unit\\Reflection\\Fixture\\DummyClassWithLazyAttribute;"," use TYPO3\\CMS\\Extbase\\Tests\\Unit\\Reflection\\Fixture\\DummyModel;"],"additions":1,"deletions":0,"truncated":false}],"additions":502,"deletions":16,"truncated":true,"file_count":14},"error":null,"fetched_at":"2026-10-20T14:26:02.958573+00:00"}